# Per-Dockerfile ignore for the mm-web image (BuildKit reads
# <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to the root .dockerignore).
#
# The ROOT .dockerignore deliberately excludes web/ to keep the mm-core build
# context at ~42MB instead of 13GB. But mm-web is built FROM web/, so it needs
# its own rules: exclude everything, then re-include only the web workspace.
*
!web/package.json
!web/package-lock.json
!web/tsconfig.base.json
!web/packages

# web/tsconfig.base.json is REQUIRED: every packages/*/tsconfig.json does
# `"extends": "../../tsconfig.base.json"`. Omitting it fails the build with
#   failed to resolve "extends":"../../tsconfig.base.json"

# ...and drop the heavy/irrelevant bits inside the workspace.
web/**/node_modules
web/**/dist
web/**/.turbo
web/**/*.tsbuildinfo
